  "description": "With 16-inch wheels, a lightweight aluminum frame, and removable training wheels, Animator makes learning to ride easy and fun. A shorter crank and narrow Q-factor make it easier to pedal, and short-reach brake levers give young riders confident stopping power. It also has an adjustable riding position and longer insertion depth for the seatpost, which makes it easier to achieve a perfect fit for kids of different heights. It comes with removable training wheels, so it’s easy to get started and then graduate to two wheels whenever they’re ready.",
